# An effect, authored as a sprite because that is what an effect is here: one
# more layer with its own clock, not a filter on the thing underneath. A
# twinkle, five by three, that a compositor would stamp over a wing tip or a
# bill. It uses light and eye-ring only, so a colourway dresses it with the
# same two colours it dresses any highlight with.
sprite glint

frame 90ms
art
.....
..X..
.....

frame 70ms
art
..X..
.XWX.
..X..

frame 50ms
art
.X.X.
..W..
.X.X.

frame 260ms
art
.....
.....
.....
